The two biggest challenges we had were, first, migrating to AWS — you have to rethink each system rather than just migrating everything V2V. Sometimes it made sense to containerize the app and send it to ECS or EKS; sometimes you could merge 3 VMs (web, app, database) into one to reduce AWS usage. And on the other hand, working on legacy systems that hadn’t the chance to evolve to those best practices was challenging — you had to understand how the system works, read logs, test, and improve.

